Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qiu Siping said
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that this cave belonged to an ancient cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe one of these texts has hints about the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found it !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is only a single way to overcome
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,the limits of the Ji Realm:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:18.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Abandon the cultivation the Ji Realm granted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shatter your cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,After shattering your cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ji Realm will dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the only way to escape the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivate from zero
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and redo all your breakthroughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that you need to discard your Ancient God body ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Divine Path... So this is the Divine Path !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Create an avatar to cultivate simultaneously with the main body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:45.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and merge the two bodies to form a Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can use the Divine Path to create an avatar and form my Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is that any different ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:57.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, the avatar must also cultivate from scratch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the Nascent Soul breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and merge with the original body to attempt to form a Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to form an avatar before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,because I didn't have enough pills and artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the harvest from the Land of the Ancient God,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,this looks like the perfect time and place to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's too risky !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The avatar's lifespan will only be 30 years !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't form a Nascent Soul within 30 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will all be for nothing !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:20.56,Second,,0,0,0,,No need to discuss this any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must form Nascent Soul in order to get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The country of Chu is at the north of the Burning Fire country
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and at the east of the country of Xuanwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It also shares a border with the Sea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,next to the Broken Rocks Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its territory is vast
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and is populated by many cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just a rank 3 country,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's at the pinnacle of rank 3 countries thanks to the Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:06.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1435,474)}Cloud Sky Sect\NCountry of Chu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,a major sect specialized in alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will eventually produce a Soul Formation cultivator and rise to rank 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:20.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1549,517)\fad(300,300)}Cheng Fei\NSword Qi Sect disciple\NLate stage Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:26.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1297,456)\fad(300,300)}Cheng Ling\NEarly stage Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are still 1000 li away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did we land here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to become a disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,then why do I have to walk ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,everyone else is walking too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a show of respect towards the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, why do you want me to join the Cloud Sky Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to refine pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to join Sword Qi Sect like you !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Cloud Sky Sect is the strongest in the country of Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cloud Sky Sect once refined a grade 5 pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,In order to buy that pill, a rank 4 country
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,specially created a formation for the Cloud Sky Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,that even ordinary rank 4 countries would struggle to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, that does pique my interest a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,once I join the Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:16.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will make pills
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,to help you in your cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you think entering Cloud Sky Sect will be easy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,They only recruit every 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only do major families of Chu send their descendents here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:31.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,but many rogue cultivators also try their chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thousands will participate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,but less than 10 will be accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,a girl as adorable as me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is sure to be chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You might not know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the Cloud Sky Sect's recruitment is quite peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unlike other sects that value talent and spiritual roots,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,they value fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, look at that person !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are his clothes are so funny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:57.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you here to join the sect as well ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed like a beggar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you mute ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:08.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a pointless question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why else would I be heading to the Cloud Sky Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1558,487)}Wang Lin's avatar\N3rd layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:15.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,You’ve always been spoiled for being cute
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you rarely get ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s been so long since I felt the fatigue of a mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,why must you participate in this disciple selection ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I came out of the Sea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,specifically for this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can become a sect disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will use the Cloud Sky Sect's help
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,to form my Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The will of the heavens is unpredictable...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:52.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never thought that I'd join a sect again one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Among the candidates
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are 2nd and 3rd layers of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and also people up to Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:34.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1431,546)\fad(300,300)}Zhou Lin\NCloud Sky Sect 9th generation disciple\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you wish to join the Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,your seniority will be low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you’re not willing, then leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since no one left,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,then let's start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cloud Sky Sect’s disciple selection begins now !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s starting, it’s starting !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using whatever method you choose,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,as long as you can feel what substance is inside this pillar
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you'll be qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have 6 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:31.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saw nothing !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:34.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Watch me !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,My artifact !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,He lost his artifact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may use any method you can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,your artifacts will be returned after the selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,My turn !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll try too !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Me too !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:20.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, why aren’t you moving yet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:23.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,There clearly is some kind of restriction to prevent anyone from probing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’re an Enlightened of Ancient God restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if this avatar doesn't have your cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:35.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,you still have all the memories of the Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master is truly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even without his cultivation or Ji Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,he still has a domineering aura around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,11 Eleven pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,11 jade slips
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and 11 tokens engraved with pill furnaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are there different items ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Cloud Sky Sect isn't selecting experts in restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone found it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look over there !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did she do it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's no ordinary girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can actually take these things out ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:21.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the real selection has nothing to do with the candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the items inside that choose the disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 3 kinds of items
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,correspond to 3 different outcomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:34.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are the outcomes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We won't know until we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I... I passed !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a pity this pill is of the fire element.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I could've been your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on becoming an inner disciple of the Cloud Sky Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep this pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The jade slip means you pass this trial
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.44,Third,,0,0,0,,You will give it to your teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the pill makes you an inner disciple directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:00.20,Third,,0,0,0,,to thank him for accepting you as disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:04.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then what is the token ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:08.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only 1 hour is left before the end of the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,that there are 4 types of items in this pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jade slips, pills, tokens, and a pill furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,A pill furnace ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain jade slips
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:23.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,pass this test.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain a pill
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,directly become inner sect disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain a token
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,also become inner disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and can exchange the token for a grade 3 pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can obtain the pill furnace,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will become a core disciple directly under the Sect Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, quickly find it !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone will admire you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll have countless pills !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Being an inner disciple is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Water element !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will you be my disciple ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll accept this gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I got one too !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I also have one !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You got one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Dragonborn Furnace !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Sect Leader disciple will appear !--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is this lucky ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look up there !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:37.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still, he failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the past 8000 years of the Cloud Sky Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,only 6 Seniors ever got the pill furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:52.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, you need a little luck in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you can't rely on luck alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This concludes this test of the disciple selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who failed will be escorted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who obtained items,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,follow me up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:05.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:20.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a domineering pill furnace...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The buildings are entirely made of jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This alchemy sect must be really wealthy !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:43.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such abundant spiritual energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cloud Sky Sect really is an excellent place for cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:08.16,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1408,563)\fad(300,000)}Song Qing\NCloud Sky Sect Leader\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,9th generation disciple Zhou Lin, pays respects to Sect Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here are the 6 who passed the disciple selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 obtained jade slips
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,2 obtained pills
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and 1 obtained a token.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who obtained jade slips
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have to undergo a second test
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to decide whether they become inner disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:34.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who obtained pills
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,will take 9th generation disciples as their teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sun, you choose your disciple first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sect Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:52.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1527,501)}Sun Zhenwei\N9th generation Cloud Sky Sect disciple\NLate stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:16:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sect Leader, disciple wishes to take this person as disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,He obtained a water element pill
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:05.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,that perfectly matches my current needs for alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sun, are you willing to yield this person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhou Lin is Elder Li’s only disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I wish to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:21.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then who will you choose ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple pays respects to Teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You haven’t obtained inner disciple qualifications yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't choose your teacher yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:37.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This girl is quite clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although you only obtained a jade slip,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,your courage is commendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:44.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll make an exception and take you as my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for the inner disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sect Leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,is this acceptable ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This... this is against the sect's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,No problem, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:16:59.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Junior Sun has spoken,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,then let it be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:07.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cloud Sky Sect is divided into the inner and outer sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The inner sect refines pills
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the outer sect guards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.24,0:17:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you are an inner disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will focus on alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such extravagance !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are so many precious plants
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,in this disciple's garden !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are my first disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:38.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will live in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will go in seclusion for several months
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,to absorb the Water Spirit Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:46.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will find
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,my insights on alchemy inside this jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,along with pill formulas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Read them for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:55.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will teach you personally when I come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.12,0:17:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may freely use
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,the herbs in this garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,But remember, don’t uproot them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is my greeting gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Teacher !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,During my seclusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:15.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you have any questions about alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,go find your Grandteacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,She is very kind
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and will explain to you the details
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,about the inner workings of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just a heads up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’re still young
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,so while I’m in seclusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,take good care of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and remember to never cut corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This small pill furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the same quality as the Hundred Beasts Spirit Furnace I traded for in the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:51.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cheap Master of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,is surprisingly kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teacher, Teacher !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a disciple !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:36.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:36.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:40.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:45.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:45.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:51.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:55.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:20:01.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:20:01.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:06.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:06.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:10.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:10.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:14.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:14.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:18.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:26.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:26.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:33.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:33.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:41.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:41.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:50.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:50.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:12.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:12.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:19.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:19.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:29.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:29.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:37.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:37.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
